{"number":82,"name":"سُورَةُ الانفِطَارِ","englishName":"Al-Infitaar","englishNameTranslation":"The Cleaving","numberOfAyahs":19,"items":[{"id":"q:82:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنفَطَرَتْ","en":"When the sky breaks apart","bn":"যখন আকাশ বিদীর্ণ হবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/1"},{"id":"q:82:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْكَوَاكِبُ ٱنتَثَرَتْ","en":"And when the stars fall, scattering,","bn":"যখন নক্ষত্রসমূহ ঝরে পড়বে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/2"},{"id":"q:82:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ فُجِّرَتْ","en":"And when the seas are erupted","bn":"যখন সমুদ্রকে উত্তাল করে তোলা হবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/3"},{"id":"q:82:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْقُبُورُ بُعْثِرَتْ","en":"And when the [contents of] graves are scattered,","bn":"এবং যখন কবরসমূহ উম্মোচিত হবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/4"},{"id":"q:82:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌۭ مَّا قَدَّمَتْ وَأَخَّرَتْ","en":"A soul will [then] know what it has put forth and kept back.","bn":"তখন প্রত্যেকে জেনে নিবে সে কি অগ্রে প্রেরণ করেছে এবং কি পশ্চাতে ছেড়ে এসেছে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/5"},{"id":"q:82:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَا غَرَّكَ بِرَبِّكَ ٱلْكَرِيمِ","en":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous,","bn":"হে মানুষ, কিসে তোমাকে তোমার মহামহিম পালনকর্তা সম্পর্কে বিভ্রান্ত করল?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/6"},{"id":"q:82:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكَ فَسَوَّىٰكَ فَعَدَلَكَ","en":"Who created you, proportioned you, and balanced you?","bn":"যিনি তোমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর তোমাকে সুবিন্যস্ত করেছেন এবং সুষম করেছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/7"},{"id":"q:82:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فِىٓ أَىِّ صُورَةٍۢ مَّا شَآءَ رَكَّبَكَ","en":"In whatever form He willed has He assembled you.","bn":"যিনি তোমাকে তাঁর ইচ্ছামত আকৃতিতে গঠন করেছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/8"},{"id":"q:82:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا بَلْ تُكَذِّبُونَ بِٱلدِّينِ","en":"No! But you deny the Recompense.","bn":"কখনও বিভ্রান্ত হয়ো না; বরং তোমরা দান-প্রতিদানকে মিথ্যা মনে কর।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/9"},{"id":"q:82:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكُمْ لَحَٰفِظِينَ","en":"And indeed, [appointed] over you are keepers,","bn":"অবশ্যই তোমাদের উপর তত্ত্বাবধায়ক নিযুক্ত আছে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/10"},{"id":"q:82:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كِرَامًۭا كَٰتِبِينَ","en":"Noble and recording;","bn":"সম্মানিত আমল লেখকবৃন্দ।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/11"},{"id":"q:82:12","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":12,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ مَا تَفْعَلُونَ","en":"They know whatever you do.","bn":"তারা জানে যা তোমরা কর।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/12"},{"id":"q:82:13","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":13,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّ ٱلْأَبْرَارَ لَفِى نَعِيمٍۢ","en":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure,","bn":"সৎকর্মশীলগণ থাকবে জান্নাতে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/13"},{"id":"q:82:14","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":14,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِنَّ ٱلْفُجَّارَ لَفِى جَحِيمٍۢ","en":"And indeed, the wicked will be in Hellfire.","bn":"এবং দুষ্কর্মীরা থাকবে জাহান্নামে;","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/14"},{"id":"q:82:15","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":15,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ","en":"They will [enter to] burn therein on the Day of Recompense,","bn":"তারা বিচার দিবসে তথায় প্রবেশ করবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/15"},{"id":"q:82:16","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":16,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَا هُمْ عَنْهَا بِغَآئِبِينَ","en":"And never therefrom will they be absent.","bn":"তারা সেখান থেকে পৃথক হবে না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/16"},{"id":"q:82:17","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":17,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلدِّينِ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense?","bn":"আপনি জানেন, বিচার দিবস কি?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/17"},{"id":"q:82:18","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":18,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ مَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلدِّينِ","en":"Then, what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense?","bn":"অতঃপর আপনি জানেন, বিচার দিবস কি?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/18"},{"id":"q:82:19","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":82,"ayah":19,"surahName":"Al-Infitaar","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَوْمَ لَا تَمْلِكُ نَفْسٌۭ لِّنَفْسٍۢ شَيْـًۭٔا ۖ وَٱلْأَمْرُ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ لِّلَّهِ","en":"It is the Day when a soul will not possess for another soul [power to do] a thing; and the command, that Day, is [entirely] with Allah.","bn":"যেদিন কেউ কারও কোন উপকার করতে পারবে না এবং সেদিন সব কতৃꦣ2468;্ব হবে আল্লাহর।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/82/19"}]}